+## Blooper
+
+When the user asks to keep a mistake as a blooper, that mistake becomes a span of its own (cut at both ends,
+followed by the right take), and `edits/<name>/bloopers.json` gets the take's seconds:
+`{"items": [{"start": s, "end": e}]}`. `render.py` then renders that span black and white, with the voice 22%
+lower at the same length (a span only partly inside an item is skipped, with a warning). At most one per video.
+
